{"id":"4088d59cd79fc260","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-clause-assignment-graph.md","title":"Clause Assignment Graph Preserves Optimum","display":"lem-clause-assignment-graph — Clause Assignment Graph Preserves Optimum","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-clause-assignment-graph","aliases":["28-lem-clause-assignment-graph"],"display":"lem-clause-assignment-graph — Clause Assignment Graph Preserves Optimum","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 11.16; explicit three-distinct-literal version","source_printed_pages":"247","source_pdf_pages":"273","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-clause-assignment-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-clause-assignment-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-clause-assignment-graph — Clause Assignment Graph Preserves Optimum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma 11.16; explicit three-distinct-literal version"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"247"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"273"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[j]=\\{1,\\ldots,j\\}\">\\([j]=\\{1,\\ldots,j\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi=(C_1,\\ldots,C_m)\">\\(\\Phi=(C_1,\\ldots,C_m)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 变量3CNF；每个子句恰含三个不同变量且无互补对。</li>\n<li>每个子句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_i\">\\(C_i\\)</span> 表示为三个带符号文字 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(j,b)\\in[n]\\times\\{0,1\\}\">\\((j,b)\\in[n]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 的集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=1\">\\(b=1\\)</span> 表示正文字、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=0\">\\(b=0\\)</span> 表示负文字；三个文字的变量索引互异。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 为包含该子句变量的坐标集上的布尔赋值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_i\">\\(S_i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_i(a)\">\\(C_i(a)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)\">\\(\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)\\)</span> 与有限简单图的独立数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha(G)\">\\(\\alpha(G)\\)</span> 均由下式内建；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E)\">\\(G=(V,E)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_i\\coloneqq\\{j\\in[n]:\\exists b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;(j,b)\\in C_i\\},\\qquad C_i(a)\\coloneqq1-\\prod_{(j,b)\\in C_i}\\left(1-\\mathbf1_{\\{b\\}}(a(j))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_i\\coloneqq\\{j\\in[n]:\\exists b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;(j,b)\\in C_i\\},\\qquad C_i(a)\\coloneqq1-\\prod_{(j,b)\\in C_i}\\left(1-\\mathbf1_{\\{b\\}}(a(j))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha(G)\\coloneqq\\max\\{|I|:I\\subseteq V,\\ \\forall u\\ne v\\in I\\ \\{u,v\\}\\notin E\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq m^{-1}\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}\\sum_{i=1}^m C_i(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha(G)\\coloneqq\\max\\{|I|:I\\subseteq V,\\ \\forall u\\ne v\\in I\\ \\{u,v\\}\\notin E\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq m^{-1}\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}\\sum_{i=1}^m C_i(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_\\Phi\\coloneqq\\{(i,a):i\\in[m],\\ a:S_i\\to\\{0,1\\},\\ C_i(a)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_\\Phi\\coloneqq\\{(i,a):i\\in[m],\\ a:S_i\\to\\{0,1\\},\\ C_i(a)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_\\Phi\\coloneqq\\{\\{(i,a),(j,b)\\}:(i,a),(j,b)\\in V_\\Phi,\\ (i,a)\\ne(j,b),\\ i=j\\lor\\exists k\\in S_i\\cap S_j\\ a(k)\\ne b(k)\\},\\qquad G_\\Phi\\coloneqq(V_\\Phi,E_\\Phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_\\Phi\\coloneqq\\{\\{(i,a),(j,b)\\}:(i,a),(j,b)\\in V_\\Phi,\\ (i,a)\\ne(j,b),\\ i=j\\lor\\exists k\\in S_i\\cap S_j\\ a(k)\\ne b(k)\\},\\qquad G_\\Phi\\coloneqq(V_\\Phi,E_\\Phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|V_\\Phi|=7m,\\qquad \\alpha(G_\\Phi)=m\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|V_\\Phi|=7m,\\qquad \\alpha(G_\\Phi)=m\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个三变量子句有7个满足赋值。任一全局赋值为每个满足子句选一个局部赋值，得到独立集。反向，独立集每个子句至多选一顶点，且所有所选赋值在交叠变量上相容，可统一延拓成全局赋值，满足至少对应子句数。两向界给等式。三互异变量假设避免一般3CNF中顶点数不等于7m。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 11.16; explicit three-distinct-literal version；印刷页 247；PDF 页 273。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第11章的 Clause Assignment Graph Preserves Optimum，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"[j]=\\{1,\\ldots,j\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi=(C_1,\\ldots,C_m)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"C_i","display":false},{"tex":"(j,b)\\in[n]\\times\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"b=1","display":false},{"tex":"b=0","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"S_i","display":false},{"tex":"C_i(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G=(V,E)","display":false},{"tex":"S_i\\coloneqq\\{j\\in[n]:\\exists b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;(j,b)\\in C_i\\},\\qquad C_i(a)\\coloneqq1-\\prod_{(j,b)\\in C_i}\\left(1-\\mathbf1_{\\{b\\}}(a(j))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha(G)\\coloneqq\\max\\{|I|:I\\subseteq V,\\ \\forall u\\ne v\\in I\\ \\{u,v\\}\\notin E\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq m^{-1}\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}\\sum_{i=1}^m C_i(x).","display":true},{"tex":"V_\\Phi\\coloneqq\\{(i,a):i\\in[m],\\ a:S_i\\to\\{0,1\\},\\ C_i(a)=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"E_\\Phi\\coloneqq\\{\\{(i,a),(j,b)\\}:(i,a),(j,b)\\in V_\\Phi,\\ (i,a)\\ne(j,b),\\ i=j\\lor\\exists k\\in S_i\\cap S_j\\ a(k)\\ne b(k)\\},\\qquad G_\\Phi\\coloneqq(V_\\Phi,E_\\Phi).","display":true},{"tex":"|V_\\Phi|=7m,\\qquad \\alpha(G_\\Phi)=m\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi).","display":true}],"bytes":2602,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-329","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-qcsp]]、[[28-lem-clause-assignment-graph]]、[[28-prop-independent-set-product]]、[[28-prop-vertex-cover-gap-transfer]]。"},{"id":"ecdcf4d005142ad9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Phi$ 满足 [[28-lem-clause-assignment-graph]] 的假设，$m$ 为子句数，$G_\\Phi=(V_\\Phi,E_\\Phi)$ 使用该节点的构造。"}],"outgoing":[]}